;THERE ARE THREE COMPLEXES OF TRANSDUCIN ALPHA, GTP GAMMA S,
AND MG+2 PER ASYMMETRIC UNIT.  THE CHAIN IDENTIFIES ARE A,
B, AND C.

THE TRANSFORMATION PRESENTED ON *MTRIX 1* RECORDS BELOW
WILL YIELD APPROXIMATE COORDINATES FOR CHAIN *A* WHEN
APPLIED TO CHAIN *B*.  THE TRANSFORMATION PRESENTED ON
*MTRIX 2* RECORDS BELOW WILL YIELD APPROXIMATE COORDINATES
FOR CHAIN *A* WHEN APPLIED TO CHAIN *C*.
;
? 
2 ? ? 
3 ? ? 
